export anchor PlayingCardsStyle:
    number: 99
    screen: ProjectsDashboard
    name: Playing cards
    idea: The dashboard dealt onto a light sage card table, with every project a playing card whose suit is its status, the totals held as a fanned hand and the fortnight stacked in chips.
    base: light
    palette:
        sageFelt: #dfe8d8, the card table and the page
        feltShade: #c9d6c0, the top rail and card lips
        cardWhite: #fffdf8, cards, panels and fields
        cardInk: #16130f, text and outlines
        tableGrey: #38423a, captions and meta
        clubGreen: #1e5b3a, the club suit for On track
        diamondAmber: #8a4b00, the diamond suit for At risk
        spadeRed: #9b1c1c, the spade suit for Behind, overdue and week two chips
        chipBlue: #2c4f8a, week one chips, card back avatars, links and the primary button
        brass: #c9a44a, the focus halo, never text
    type:
        Indices and names use Georgia, Cambria, Times New Roman, serif in
        bold. Text uses Gill Sans, Gill Sans MT, Seravek, Calibri, Segoe UI,
        sans-serif. The greeting is 32 to 48px, hand ranks 46px, section
        heads 26px, card corner indices 18px, card names 18px, body 15px and
        caps labels 11 to 13px tracked 0.14em.
    layout:
        A sage rail holds a small white card logo with a diamond, the brand,
        nav links with an underline on the current one, a white search
        field, the bell, a blue New project button and the user as a blue
        card back with initials. The top is split in two, the date, greeting
        and a white overdue slip on the left, and the four totals on the
        right as a fanned hand of white cards turned from minus 9 to 9
        degrees, each with a corner rank, a big number and a caps label,
        the overdue card in red. The deal is a row of six playing cards on
        the felt, each 5 by 7.4 with an inner hairline frame, the percent
        and suit as corner indices top left and upside down bottom right,
        and the team, name, a large suit pip, percent, tasks, due and status
        in the middle. Below, Chips won stacks poker chips per day beside
        Hand history, a list with card back avatars. Cards go three across
        below 1100px, the hand straightens into a two by two grid on phones
        and cards go two across.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 20px between cards, 16px inside a card and 40 to 48px between sections.
    density: Roomy. Six cards in one row on a wide table.
    corners: 10px on cards and panels, 8px on buttons and fields, 5px on card back avatars, round chips.
    borders: A 1px warm grey card edge with an inner hairline frame 6px in.
    shadows: Cards cast 0 2px 0 felt shade plus 0 8px 18px rgba(30,50,30,0.18). Hand cards lift a little more.
    icons:
        The suit shapes drawn solid in SVG. Club for On track, diamond for At
        risk and spade for Behind and overdue, each with its word. People are
        blue card backs with diagonal stripes and initials.
    focus: A 2px ink outline offset 2px inside a 6px brass halo.
    tone: Card room words in plain sentences, such as The deal, Chips won, Hand history and Play those first.
